e sleep.", "end_ms": 345000, "start_ms": 230000}, {"text": "When they go camping, and number three, what''s one bad thing about traveling during the summer? Okay, before we go, remember to sign up for our one dollar listening practice seminars and download the Listening Time podcast so you can practice your listening skills. And of course, subscribe to the channel, click on the bell, and follow us on Instagram. I''ll see you next time.", "end_ms": 382979, "start_ms": 345000}], "timestamps": []}'::jsonb,'{"accent": "US", "locale": "vi-VN", "density": "AUTO", "activities": ["SHADOWING", "DICTATION"], "annotations": ["LEXICAL", "TRANSLATION", "PROFILE", "GRAMMAR"], "grammarLimit": 8, "vocabularyLimit": 20, "pronunciationProvider": "LOCAL", "pronunciationStrategy": "PREGENERATE"}'::jsonb,NULL,NULL,'{"key": "98cd77ded64a079a21ffb6f791e22735dd034a6b7ba7892b218973cfefa4efb2", "cefr": "B1", "manual": false, "contentType": "MONOLOGUE"}'::jsonb,FALSE,NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
