 ''và sách mà không có tranh hoặc hội thoại thì có ích gì,'' Alice nghĩ.", "contentStale": false, "manualFields": [], "timingSource": null, "coarseStartMs": 320, "manualLocales": {}, "manualSources": {}, "thoughtGroups": [], "cefrSuggestion": "B2", "ipaNeedsReview": true, "contentWarnings": [], "dictationEligible": true, "dictationPriority": null, "dictationSelected": true, "ipaDisplayVersion": "learner-ipa-v1", "shadowingEligible": true, "shadowingPriority": null, "shadowingSelected": true, "contentTypeSuggestion": "STORY"}, {"id": "48002dde-167f-4200-bfb3-c994d09d7577", "ipa": "sˌoʊ ʃiː wʌz kənsˈɪdɚrɪŋ ɪn hɜːr ˈoʊn mˈaɪnd æz wˈɛl æz ʃiː kˈʊd fɚðə hˈɑːt dˈeɪ mˌeɪd hɜː fˈiːl vˈɛri slˈiːpi ænd stˈuːpɪd wˈɛðɚ ðə plˈɛʒɚr ʌv mˌeɪkɪŋ ɐ dˈeɪzitʃˈeɪn wʊd biː wˈɜːθ ðə trˈʌbəl ʌv ɡˌɛɾɪŋ ˌʌp ænd pˈɪkɪŋ ðə dˈeɪziz wˌɛn sˈʌdənli ɐ wˈaɪt rˈæbɪt wɪð pˈɪŋk ˈaɪz rˈæn klˈoʊs baɪ hɜː", "text": "So she was considering in her own mind (as well as she could, for the hot day made her feel very sleepy and stupid), whether the pleasure of making a daisy-chain would be worth the trouble of getting up and picking the daisies, when suddenly a White Rabbit with pink eyes ran close by her.", "cloze": {"easy": [6, 9, 15, 21, 26, 30, 31, 36, 44, 48, 52], "text": "So she was considering in her own mind (as well as she could, for the hot day made her feel very sleepy and stupid), whether the pleasure of making a daisy-chain would be worth the trouble of getting up and picking the daisies, when suddenly a White Rabbit with pink eyes ran close by her.", "medium": [3, 6, 7, 9, 15, 16, 17, 19, 21, 23, 26, 28, 30, 31, 34, 36, 38, 41, 44, 48, 50, 52], "version": "cloze-v2", "textHash": "bcc1283dd130bea7e0770f8d354880f7ee1085748a4c5ee7d75cc59cef3d21fa"}, "hints": [], "notes": [], "usage": "LEARN", "words": [{"text": "So", "endMs": 18000, "charEnd": 2, "startMs": 17760, "tokenEnd": 1, "charStart": 0, "tokenStart": 0}, {"text": "she", "endMs": 18160, "charEnd": 6, "startMs": 18000, "tokenEnd": 2, "charStart